<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  LineageOS-owned hardware glue for Yugen.

  Yugen runs the stock AOSP platform. These repos are the device-enablement
  layer: Qualcomm/CAF HALs, vendor blobs, extraction tools, and the legacy
  hardware shims that LineageOS device trees expect. Nothing here is a
  LineageOS platform fork (no build/make, art, bionic, frameworks).

  Curated by hand from LineageOS's manifest. Add entries here only when the
  repo is generic (needed by many trees) and hardware-shaped; device-specific
  trees, kernels and blobs belong in snippets/devices.xml.

  The same repository appears at several hardware/qcom-caf/<soc>/ paths on
  purpose: each SoC needs its own branch of the same HAL source, which is why
  the per-entry revision matters and must not be replaced by the remote default.
-->
